-- Migration 9 → 10: retire the ambient-context layer.
--
-- WeatherContextProvider called api.open-meteo.com without user
-- initiation (ADR-0006 violation); the health/screen-time/notification-
-- listener providers were a privacy surface the Mac product (macos/
-- docs/CONTEXT_TOOLS_PLAN.md) explicitly parked, because spoken/sensed
-- context facts risk getting distilled into permanent memory unasked.
-- Android must not ship what the Mac product considers unsafe.
--
-- ContextSnapshot was write-only: ChatScreenViewModel.storeContextSnapshots
-- inserted rows on every welcome message, but TrendAnalyzer (the reader
-- it was built for) never actually queried the table — grep confirms
-- zero SELECT call sites outside this .sq file's own generated code.
-- With the context providers gone, nothing produces rows for it either.
--
-- SQLite: nothing references ContextSnapshot as a FK. Safe, one-way drop,
-- same shape as migrations 7, 8 and 9.
--
-- MurphySig: kev+claude / confidence 0.9 / 2026-08-20

DROP TABLE IF EXISTS ContextSnapshot;
